{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vIHoYScU381792746679.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>山頂光影項目引發爭議，旅遊事務專員視察後指，將盡快處理能即時做到的措施，下月向區議會提交優化方案。</p><p></p><p>旅遊事務專員陳慧欣與旅發局代表，偕同部分立法會議員及區議員視察，解說項目理念及，項目可作出的調整等。文體旅局指，非常重視議員及居民的意見，議員提出移除佔用休息空間的地面燈具等提議，將盡快處理能即時做到的措施。未來數日會繼續與不同的議員，實地視察及聽取意見。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.PEAK.FOLO-1600_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PI00bGfyyA1792746688.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>旅遊事務署與旅發局下月亦會向中西區區議會提交優化方案，諮詢區議會意見。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:40.674698+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":214,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T18:38:08.839102+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:38:49.160196+00:00","content_hash":"a577ac179fbb8d3f5e368348de5b2d02fc00922e5172c02afd487435f89aa49a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:44:40.674698+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}